{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/chat_panel

    The page the chat of the centre shows beside a conversation (chatpanel::page()):
    a head with the mark of Eguahe; without a session in this browser, a card that says why and opens the way in
    apart (the page of entering is never inside another page); with it, the place where the family appears when the
    chat says who writes (pub/chat.js, which asks chat.php and puts chat_family here). While it looks, the shape of a
    card in grey (data-chat-cargando, a template the script clones) instead of a sentence.

    Example context (json):
    {"in": true, "team": true, "loginurl": "#", "url": "#", "sesskey": "x", "origins": "[]", "logo": "#"}
}}
<main class="chat-familia" data-chat data-url="{{url}}" data-sesskey="{{sesskey}}" data-origins="{{origins}}" data-loading="{{#str}}chat_loading, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}" data-failed="{{#str}}chat_failed, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}" data-none="{{#str}}chat_waiting_contact, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}">
    <header class="chat-cabeza"><img src="{{logo}}" alt="" width="22" height="22"><span>{{#str}}chat_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</span></header>
    {{^in}}
    <div class="chat-entrar">
        <h2 class="chat-nombre">{{#str}}chat_login_title, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</h2>
        <p class="chat-aviso">{{#str}}chat_login, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>
        <p class="chat-entrar-botones"><a class="boton principal" href="{{loginurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}}chat_login_button, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a> <a class="enlace" href="{{url}}">{{#str}}chat_login_done, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</a></p>
    </div>
    {{/in}}
    {{#in}}
    {{^team}}<p class="chat-aviso chat-suelto">{{#str}}chat_noteam, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p>{{/team}}
    {{#team}}<div class="chat-salida" data-chat-out aria-live="polite"><p class="chat-aviso chat-suelto">{{#str}}chat_waiting_contact, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}</p></div>
    <template data-chat-cargando><div class="chat-cargando" aria-label="{{#str}}chat_loading, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></template>{{/team}}
    {{/in}}
</main>
